    "caveats": [
      "Timing mismatch: VEP is anchored to 2024; registration numbers reflect 2025–mid-2026 rolls. Population growth, new registrations, and list cleaning cause some divergence.",
      "Rates above ~90–100% occur in states with slower list maintenance or high mobility (inactive voters still on rolls).",
      "North Dakota has no voter registration system; the listed registered figure is an estimate/placeholder and not directly comparable.",
      "Registration rate = Registered ÷ VEP. Mid-2026 data is incomplete or estimated in places because states update rolls on different schedules.",
      "No single official, fully contemporaneous national snapshot exists as of August 2026."
